<title>SLOVENIA: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>KRANJSKA GORA, Slovenia 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first leg</p>
<p>times in a men's alpine skiing World Cup giant slalom on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Michael Von Gruenigen (Switzerland) one minute 07.21 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Siegfried Voglreiter (Austria)		    1:07.91</p>
<p> 3. Kjetil Andre Aamodt (Norway)			1:07.99</p>
<p> 4. Hans Knauss (Austria)				 1:08.01</p>
<p> 5. Ian Piccard (France)				  1:08.08</p>
<p> 6. Urs Kaelin (Switzerland)			    1:08.10</p>
<p> 7. Alberto Tomba (Italy)				 1:08.11</p>
<p> 8. Matteo Nana (Italy)				   1:08.21</p>
<p> 9. Thomas Grandi (Canada)				1:08.24</p>
<p> 10. Gerhard Koenigsrainer (Italy)		    1:08.38</p>
</text>
